<h1>Welcome to THENCF!</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.profile&.name || @user.email_address.split("@").first %>,</p>

<p>Great news! Your account has been approved. You can now sign in and access all member features.</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Sign in to THENCF", new_session_url %>
</p>

<p>
  As a member you can:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Browse and participate in the community forum</li>
  <li>View funding opportunities</li>
  <li>Book spaces (once your membership is active)</li>
  <li>Connect with other artists in the collective</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Welcome to the North Connacht Cultural Co-op community!
</p>

<p>
  Best regards,<br>
  THENCF Team
</p>
